            </note>
            <note corresp="#d189-f4" n="4" xml:id="d189-f4-content">
                <p>Reference is to the meeting of the 16 held on May 21; see telegram Secto 277. May
                    21, <ref target="#pg304">p. 304</ref>; there was no meeting on May 22.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d189-f5" n="5" xml:id="d189-f5-content">
                <p>Same as telegram 74, May 13. from Geneva, <ref target="#pg264">p. 264</ref>.</p>
